ISUCON14 benchmarker

Usage:
  bench [command]

Available Commands:
  completion         Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  generate-init-data 初期データをDBに生成する
  help               Help about any command
  run                Run a benchmark
  version            Print the version number

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for bench
  -v, --version   version for bench

Use "bench [command] --help" for more information about a command.
